OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fand overnight the north will be
OL,7,Fcloudier with a few showers,
OL,8,Fespecially over Caithness and
OL,9,FSutherland. Further south, including
OL,10,FLochaber and Great Glen, will stay dry
OL,11,Fwith long clear spells. A cold, frosty
OL,12,Fnight, especially under clearer skies.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FCloudy with showers continuing
OL,15,Fin the north. The south will stay dry
OL,16,Fwith some longer sunny spells
OL,17,Fdeveloping. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
