OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry Saturday and Sunday with sunny
OL,7,Fspells and the odd shower possible.
OL,8,FMostly dry and bright on Monday but
OL,9,Fchance of some rain later.
